55:41.640 --> 55:42.830
Yes.

55:42.830 --> 55:43.830
For all intents and purposes?

55:43.830 --> 55:44.830
Yes.

55:44.830 --> 55:45.990
Always?

55:45.990 --> 55:46.990
I don't know about always,

55:46.990 --> 55:48.990
