55:48.990 --> 55:50.990
for most of recorded history.

55:50.990 --> 55:55.990
At least some element of this has been here for most of human recorded history.

55:55.990 --> 55:58.990
You think we would see them if they didn't let us see them?

55:58.990 --> 56:01.990
Even with our more advanced sensors that they pop up,

