59:51.380 --> 59:55.380
Intelligence agencies who have infiltrated or created these things.

59:55.380 --> 59:56.380
Correct.

59:56.380 --> 59:58.380
I have directly experienced that, sadly,

59:58.380 --> 01:00:00.380
